  brass_check.xml — the brass check box (brass 1.4.0): its own drawable, no buttonTint, so on
  and off read the same with the remote's focus (the system one, tinted amber, filled the mark
  under focus); the focus frame is focus_ring.xml around the row.
-->
<selector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android">
    <item android:state_checked="true" android:drawable="@drawable/brass_check_on" />
    <item android:drawable="@drawable/brass_check_off" />
</selector>
